{"id": "3326728", "name": "מסה של טטראהדרון – אינטגרל משולש", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">מסה של טטראהדרון באמצעות אינטגרל משולש</div><p>נתון הטטראהדרון שקודקודיו</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle\n      (0,0,0),\\\n      ({{CT:0}},0,0),\\\n      (0,{{CT:1}},0),\\\n      (0,0,{{CT:2}})\n       \\]</p><p>צפיפות המסה היא</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle\n      \\rho(x,y,z)={{CT:3}}\n       \\]</p><p>כתבו את המסה כאינטגרל בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dz\\,dy\\,dx\\)</span> בצורה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle\n      M=\n      \\int_a^b\n      \\int_0^{c(x)}\n      \\int_0^{d(x,y)}\n      \\rho(x,y,z)\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx\n       \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>גבולות האינטגרציה</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle a=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle b=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"height:8px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle c(x)=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle d(x,y)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>המסה</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle M=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מתארים את הטטראהדרון באי-שוויונות (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\)</span> עד המישור, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x,y)\\)</span> במשולש ההטלה), ומחשבים את האינטגרל המשולש מבפנים החוצה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — תיאור התחום (סעיף א׳)</b><br>משוואת המישור העובר בשלושת חיתוכי הצירים היא<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle \\frac{x}{{{CT:0}}}+\\frac{y}{{{CT:1}}}+\\frac{z}{{{CT:2}}}=1 \\]</p>הטטראהדרון הוא החלק של הרביע הראשון (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y,z\\ge 0\\)</span>) שמתחת למישור. לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x,y)\\)</span> בהטלה, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\)</span> עולה מ-0 עד המישור; ההטלה על מישור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(xy\\)</span> היא המשולש שבין הצירים לישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{x}{{{CT:0}}}+\\frac{y}{{{CT:1}}}=1\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle 0\\le x\\le{{CT:0}},\\qquad0\\le y\\le{{CT:4}},\\qquad0\\le z\\le{{CT:5}} \\]</p>כלומר<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a={{CT:6}},\\qquad b={{CT:7}},\\qquad c(x)={{CT:4}},\\qquad d(x,y)={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — האינטגרל הפנימי והאמצעי</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_0^{{{CT:5}}}{{CT:3}}\\,dz={{CT:8}} \\]</p>ואחר כך לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_0^{{{CT:4}}}\\left({{CT:8}}\\right)dy={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — המסה (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>נשאר לבצע את האינטגרל לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle M=\\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}\\int_0^{{{CT:4}}}\\int_0^{{{CT:5}}}{{CT:3}}\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx={{CT:10}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if is(equal(ans1,xmin)) and is(equal(ans2,xmax)) and is(equal(ans3,ymax)) and is(equal(ans4,zmax)) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "mass", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["K1", "K2", "a", "b", "c", "fam", "lam", "mass", "rho", "xmax", "xmin", "ymax", "zmax"], "nvariants": 50}